What are Car Power Sliding Door System Parts?
Car Power Sliding Door Systems are electromechanical assemblies that enable automatic opening and closing of vehicle sliding doors through button activation. These systems are primarily featured in minivans, MPVs, and luxury SUVs to enhance passenger convenience and accessibility. Key components include:
•	Drive Units - The motorized mechanism enabling door movement
•	Guide Units - Rails and rollers ensuring smooth operation
•	Lock Units - Safety mechanisms for secure closure
•	Control Modules - Electronic brains managing system operations
